/-
  LeanVM.Guest.Memory.GuestCntVX

  The guest's static certificates counting `xor` instructions (`B2C.ωArm B2C.xmssArmC .xor`),
  checked (`kvx_checked`), and the weight bounds they give (`kvx_weightLe`, `kvx_weight_le_of_stat`,
  `kvx_weight_le_of_loop`). Generated by `scripts/count/gen.py`; do not edit.
-/

